+# Consumer Boundary Decision Report Artifact Contract
+
+## Authority
+
+Authoritative for the M026 cross-consumer comparison and future extension decisions.
+
+Required files:
+
+```text
+consumer-boundary-decision-report.json
+consumer-boundary-decision-report.md
+```
+
+Compared consumers: Signal Passage and Autonomous Tic-Tac-Toe.
+
+Decision values:
+
+```text
+formalize-next
+retain-existing
+improve-diagnostics-only
+observe-more
+consumer-specific
+reject
+```
+
+Each candidate records evidence from each consumer, repeated/one-off friction, engine changes, internal API access, boilerplate, validation gaps, alternatives, decision, rationale, proposed M027 scope, and priority.
+
+Required candidates: deterministic randomness, delayed behavior, UI/HUD, prompts, persistence, scenario assertions, behavior guardrails, registration generation, sound linkage, geometry diagnostics, and external-repository split.
+
+Missing evidence becomes `observe-more`, never speculative API design.
